dsl metta

Concept:{1..1} Library
	def string title
	has:{1..*} Book
	Concept:Single:Required Catalogue
		def string endpoint = "https://library.example/catalogue?a=b"

Concept Book
	def string title
	def Author[] authors
	def boolean available = true
	def integer year = empty
	def word[]:{Fiction History Science} subjects
	facet Edition
		sub Printed
			def string isbn
			def integer:{pages} length = 120 pages
		sub Digital
			def resource file
			def double size = 1.5
	Concept:{1..*} Chapter
		def string title
		Concept:Single Index > def integer min; def integer max
		facet Indexed > def Subject[] subjects = empty
	sub Novel
		def string synopsis = "A story > another; // not a comment"

Concept Author as component > def string name
Concept Subject as generalization
	def string label

Concept Publication as component generalization
	def string publisher
Concept Magazine extends Publication as generalization
    sub Monthly > def integer issue
  	sub Quarterly > def string season
